        "original_id": "acc6d5eb-2b65-50b4-ad76-2a4acef50abb",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Lily Allen\n- Products: Alright, Still\n- Companies: Regal Recordings, BBC Radio 1\n- Systems: Myspace\n- Roles: singer, songwriter\n- Projects: recording sessions with Future Cut\n\nFacts:\n- In 2004, Lily Allen began recording Alright, Still in sessions with Future Cut.\n- In 2005, Lily Allen made some of her recordings public on Myspace.\n- In 2005, publicity from Lily Allen's Myspace demos resulted in airplay on BBC Radio 1 and a contract with Regal Recordings.\n- On 13 July 2006, Regal Recordings released Alright, Still as the debut studio album by English singer and songwriter Lily Allen.",
